; Kardan's spare card to the test centre (the cut CoP quest zat_a23): its door lock asks for exactly this item. Vanilla
; derives it from a flash drive (dev_flash_2): PDA class, which can't spawn without a hud section, and the PDA slot,
; where the engine takes whatever lies for a PDA. A plain quest item instead.
![zat_a23_access_card]:!dev_flash_2,tch_quest
quest_item      = true

; The rubble that closes the bunker's passages (shelter.script, MOUNDS): models fitted to each opening
; (tools/shelter/mound.py). Frozen once spawned, their bones left free: a shell with every bone fixed has no body to
; update and crashes the engine. shelter_zone: dug out with shovels, it opens that zone to the cleaning
; (scripts\shelter\cleaning.ltx); shelter_dig: how many full shovels it takes.
[shelter_mound_2]:physic_object
visual          = dynamics\shelter\mound_2b.ogf
script_binding  = shelter.init_mound

[shelter_mound_3]:physic_object
visual          = dynamics\shelter\mound_3a.ogf
script_binding  = shelter.init_mound
shelter_zone    = corridor
shelter_dig     = 3

[shelter_mound_4]:physic_object
visual          = dynamics\shelter\mound_4a.ogf
script_binding  = shelter.init_mound

